 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+* Footnotes are now numbered and ordered by the occurrence of their references
+  in the document rather than by the occurrence of their definitions. A new
+  configuration option for the footnotes extension, `USE_DEFINITION_ORDER`, has
+  been added to restore the previous behavior.
+
 ### Fixed
 
 * Fix handling of incomplete HTML tags in code spans in Python 3.14.
